            "notes": "Buying  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) so early in the match maybe so questionable that your enemies won't even expect it. The healing reduction is triggered everytime you set an enemie on flames (and also when Bob shoots!). Even with you don't win the round, you're gonna cause a lot of trouble using Coach Gun followed by shoots with AP and heal reduction so early",
