            "created_at": "2025-07-23T02:40:50.275023+00:00",
            "notes": "It's very common to bo gy [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) to enhance any coach gun trigger - don't do that. If you can land your shots consistently there's a way around to have your abilities often.\n\nWith [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)'s CD reduction, stacked with [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) CD reduction, and getting [My Business, My Rules](item_0dac0a70-77f1-4560-8a4d-16304c022552) as your power, you have the potencial to reduce your CD so much that you'll be able to use your skills about every 5 seconds.",
