            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-23T02:40:50.275023+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 4 comes with the oportunity to spike your shots powers with [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb). Every time you hit the following [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) shot it stacks with MOK and provides very consistent initial damage (often enough to make DPS and SUPs need to get cover)\n\nYour shot after coach gun will have:\n+ Base Dmg\n+ 40 AP (+30%) = 52 from [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) (over 3 sec)\n+ 25 Ap (30%) = 32,5 from  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) (instant)\n+ 30 % Healing Reduction (over 2 sec)\n(and make them burn for 3 seconds!)",
